# gc in Today hides done entries and entries inside done projects; gc again brings them back.
file <<END
Old: @done({today-1})
	- Inside old @due({today})
- Done task @due({today}) @done({today})
- Open task @due({today})
END
keys gt
see - Inside old  Old
see ✔ Done task
keys gc
hide Inside old
hide Done task
see - Open task
keys gc
see - Inside old  Old
